# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Git maintenance artifacts.
#
# These are not project files. They are git's own temporary objects and lock
# files, which a stale-lock cleanup once moved into _to_delete/ and which
# `git add -A` then committed by the hundred. Ignoring them is what stops the
# cycle: without these lines the artifacts return on the next `add -A`.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_to_delete/
tmp_obj_*

# Lock files. Safe for this repo, which has no package manager. If a
# dependency lockfile is ever added here (yarn.lock, Cargo.lock, composer.lock)
# it will need an explicit "!" exception below, or it will be silently skipped.
*.lock

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS and editor noise
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
